{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>And it was written in the book.</b> With a pataḥ under the bet — it is the one known in their days, and the book was lost, just as we do not find Midrash Edo and the chronicles of Solomon and the chronicles of the kings of Israel and the Book of the Wars of YHWH and the Book of Jashar."], :book :esther, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kol Sason, Krotoschin, 1840" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001728315"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:30:25.666707528Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}